    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 6
      },
      "publicNotes": "<p>Geth Rocket Troopers are geth support infantry units armed with powerful rocket launchers, providing anti-armor and anti-air capability from long range. They are equipped with shielding and usually operate alongside heavier geth units such as Armatures.</p><p>Their rockets deal heavy damage against grouped targets and vehicles, making them priority targets in any engagement. Leaving them unaddressed in cover will rapidly attrite any advancing squad.</p>",
